<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 11.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 11.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 11		July 10</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.509		  3.819</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   9.969		 11.784</p>
<p>Cash balance		  14.479		 15.603</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,269.029	     5,268.584</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $553 million were issued and $28 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
